{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act43side_level_act43side_04_end","storyGroup":"act43side","storySort":9,"storyDependence":"act43side_level_act43side_04_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"AD-4","storyName":"一个荒唐的早晨","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"迈克尔和玛丽昂发生了冲突，另一边，蒂比与莫伊拉则确认了她们的友谊。宁静的夜晚过去，第二天早晨，场工霍汀在摄影棚发现了迈克尔和玛丽昂被吊起的尸体。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act43side/level_act43side_04_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act43side_04","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":7,"next":9,"characters":["蒂比","莫伊拉","玛丽昂","迈克尔","蒂比&莫伊拉","倒霉的场工"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_62_g6_proproom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","duration":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"莫丽，昨天晚上不是迈克尔第一次找你吧？","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"你刚来蓝卡坞没多久，以你的性格，如果不是对方死缠烂打，你一定不会去碰远超自己职责范围的事。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"......","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"从道尔顿出了意外，组长被制片人辞退，我突然被要求接手道具组的第二天......迈克尔先生就找我了。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"他想要在不走正常程序、不惊动任何人的前提下离开这里。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"他的意思是不告知格蕾塔女士，也不走解约和地块离境手续？","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"可他是男主演，总会有人发现他离开的，到时候还是需要支付违约金啊？","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"除非......他正在面临某种更大的威胁，即使事后缴纳罚金也要立刻离开这里。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"他说道具组能接触到所有工具，对整个地块的构造也很熟悉，如果是我......","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"你应该能想到办法。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"嗯。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"以你的能力，或许确实能想到办法，但迈克尔的拍摄还没有结束，如果他真逃了，你被发现了......格蕾塔女士不会放过你。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"莫丽，你有没有想过，以后你就没法在蓝卡坞混下去了！","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"你有没有想过，你的姐姐该有多伤心啊！","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"姐姐......","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"你不是说，你的家人都反对你来蓝卡坞打拼，只有你的姐姐一直在鼓励你？","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"所以，你一定要做出成绩来，不为向家人证明什么......","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我只是希望不要让姐姐失望，希望她能一直一直为我高兴。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"蒂比，你......你不要生气好不好？","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"求你！","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我只是气你有事瞒着我。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我知道你不会答应迈克尔，你只是不知道该怎么拒绝他......我可以帮你的。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我知道了，蒂比。我从来没见你这么生气过......","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"......","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"看、看电影吗？","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"唉......","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"看！","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":60},{"type":"dialog","id":61},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":62},{"type":"charslot","id":63},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#1$1","id":66},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_bg_62_g12_dressingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":67},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":68},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":69},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":70,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"......你说，你想偷偷带我走？","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"是的，亲爱的。让我们温存一会儿，就赶紧回房间拿行李，好吗？","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"哪怕那个小道具师真的找到了法子，能让你避开地块离境程序......但你能避开合同的违约条款吗？","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5d/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"拍摄还没有结束，你知道格蕾塔那个女人的手段，她会让你赔偿天价的违约金！","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5d/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"都什么时候了！还避开什么合同，能避开那个杀人狂魔就行！","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"道尔顿死了，谢莉死了......你猜还有多久会轮到你和我？","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"毕竟，五年前那起意外发生的时候，你和我都曾对劳拉见死不救......","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"那个杀人狂魔可能是劳拉的情人，可能是劳拉的老爸，或者某个自诩正义使者的怪侠......总之，他在找当时相关的人索命！","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"他想让我们忏悔，想让我们赎罪！","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e7/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"亲爱的，我要带你离开这是非之地，我们还要过漫长的余生......","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"呀，真动听。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"亲爱的，你什么时候变得这么深情了？","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"啊？","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"在你对着米兰妮抛媚眼，和置景组的安娜、后勤组的米拉调情的时候......","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"天哪，你脑子里面想的竟然是和我度过漫长的余生？","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"这、这是重点吗？","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"重点是——我不会走的，迈克尔。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"而且，你也不许走。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"......","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"我好不容易才为你争取来了在格蕾塔的剧组里担当主演的机会，一人分饰三角，多么难得！","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"把握住它，你将在蓝卡坞一炮而红！","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"我们总会有别的机会......","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"看着我，迈克尔。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"你在《杜邦夫人之死》里的戏服甚至要比米兰妮——绝对女主演的戏服的做工更加精致更加抢镜......","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"你喷的香水、出席时装周的单品花的都是我的积蓄，甚至，这让你充作沃尔珀的假耳朵假尾巴也出自我的手......","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"没有我，观众们会发现你这原本在镜头前光鲜亮丽的商品一下子就......没了卖相。","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"我们在一起五年了，我为你付出了一切。如今，我的积蓄不多了，年纪也不小了......我等不起了。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"我爱你，迈克尔，别辜负我的爱。","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":116},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"你这是——爱我？","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"道尔顿死的那天，你应该很感谢米兰妮当众点破了我们俩的关系吧？","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"在所有人眼里，我是个惹是生非的花花公子，而你付出了所有，却连个名分都得不到，还要被别人揶揄......","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"多可怜，多悲情！","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"难道不是吗？","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7d/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"你也说了，你不过是在投资一件商品......投资，自然要舍得付出。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"如果道尔顿没有变成一个烂酒鬼，你当初想办法投资的应该就是他了吧？","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"你不过是一条想要寄生却找不到宿主的虫豸罢了，玛丽昂。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"你让我觉得可笑......当然，我自己也可笑透了。","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"......","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"话都说到了这个份上，我一个人走，你就留在这里吧。","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"给你个建议，你可以考虑下投资那个叫卢西恩的小白脸，他可是第一次演电影就震惊了全剧组，很有投资潜力......","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"你敢走出这里，我就立刻去向格蕾塔告发。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"你真是个冷血的疯女人，你难道不怕那个杀人魔吗？","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"我为什么要怕？","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"当年，我可是事后才知道劳拉为什么会坠亡的。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"见死不救的，只有你哦。","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a2/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"......你！","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"迈克尔","text":"——","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_npc_1838_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1839_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玛丽昂","text":"迈克尔，你在看什么？","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5d/Avg_avg_npc_1839_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1838_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":153},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":154},{"type":"text","text":"愤怒像是狂潮，在瞬间将“沃尔珀”吞没，他看向了化妆间角落的消防斧，握紧了拳头。","id":155},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":156},{"type":"dialog","id":157},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":158},{"type":"charslot","id":159},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":160},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_bg_62_g6_proproom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":161},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":162},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_oldtvelectricity","loop":"true","channel":"c","id":163},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":164},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"c","fadetime":"2","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#8$1","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#3$1","id":167},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比&莫伊拉","text":"啊——","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":170,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"主角团不该逃进动力层的！虽然地面上到处都是傀儡，但总归会有办法......对吧，莫丽？","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"同意。","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"一旦进入移动城市的地下结构，空间一下子就变得好局限，所以被“邪灵”发现后，主角团根本无路可逃......","id":175,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"最后，他们被“邪灵”一个接一个地找出来，悬吊在通风管道上，在无边的黑暗里慢慢地等待死亡......","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我参加过主创的采访会，把人吊起来这段好像取材自哥伦比亚荒野上某些部落的仪式，忏悔啊审判啊之类的......","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"不过，虽然情节发展到这里有点降智，我还是很喜欢电影在动力层里拍的这段的。","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"为什么啊？","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"全是实景拍摄哦！","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"据说是制作方已经没钱再租地块了，所以剧组偷偷潜入了其他剧组的拍摄地块，秘密拍完了这段......刺激吧？","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"欸，等等......这部电影我之前也进电影院看过，为什么好像没看到过刚刚那几个画面？","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"当然了，我们看的可是送审原片的复制碟！","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"啊——这么珍贵的资源，你是怎么弄来的？","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我......","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"哎呀，作为一个资深的恐怖片爱好者，这是必备技能啦！","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"蒂比，你有秘密哦......","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"之前就发现了，不管是电影本身，还是蓝卡坞业内的方方面面，你都懂得特别多。一个场景喷绘师能有这么多见识吗？","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"莫丽，我生气了！","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/06/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"我把压箱底的宝贝拿出来和你分享，希望你能开心一点，结果你却开始审问我，呜......","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"别哭别哭，我不问了嘛。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d4/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"让我们把注意力放在电影身上......莫丽，你别老是分神！","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8e/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"被你发现了。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"抱歉，剧组最近发生的事情太多了，我......我有点紧张......","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cd/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"有我在你身边啊！","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1831_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"说得也是！","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1831_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_4191_tippi_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"那你现在开心吗？","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_4191_tippi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":216},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":217},{"type":"charslot","id":218},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/eb/Avg_62_i12.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":219},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1","yScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.4","yScaleTo":"1.4","duration":"60","id":220},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":221},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"嗯！","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"莫丽，你听我说哦~","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"不管我是什么身份，在这个剧组里，我都是你最好最好的朋友！","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"哪怕外面有杀人魔，作为好朋友，我也会保护你！","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"工作不顺心，作为好朋友，我们要一起努力，喷绘师蒂比和道具师莫伊拉会成为蓝卡坞的黄金恐怖片拍档！","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"当然了，等到我们成了更好更好的朋友，我也会带你去见我的家人......虽然不知道到时候对你来说会是惊喜还是惊吓就是了！","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"那......","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"那到时候，蒂比，我也要带你去见我的姐姐！","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫伊拉","text":"我们可以一起分享蓝卡坞的故事，她会削苹果给我们吃，她可以半分钟削整个苹果而皮都不断哦，你会喜欢她的！","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"蒂比","text":"就这么说定了！","id":232},{"type":"text","text":"老式电视机在熄灯的房间撑出一片光亮，也照亮两个女孩的脸。各种离奇骇人的声响回荡着，但并不妨碍她们笑得灿烂。","id":233},{"type":"text","text":"她们依偎在一起，用一种两人熟悉的“恐慌”去抵御恐慌，在一份生根发芽的友情之上去畅想未来。","id":234},{"type":"text","text":"这是一个多么难得的宁静夜晚。","id":235},{"type":"dialog","id":236},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":237},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":238},{"type":"dialog","id":239},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":240},{"type":"charslot","id":241},{"type":"image","id":242},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":243},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_bg_62_g1_setting_lobby.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":244},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.4","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":245},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":246},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":247},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#4$1","duration":"1","id":248},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":249},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$kjerag_n_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act14side/m_bat_kjerag_n_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":250,"musicid":3},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"今天的摄影棚怎么这么暗？","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"唉，应该先问问小莫伊拉的，她每天都来得很早，最清楚电闸在哪里。","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#5$1","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"道具间应该没那么远啊，难道我一直在原地打转......嘶，这可不太对劲......","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":255},{"type":"charslot","id":256},{"type":"playsound","key":"$blooddrop","volume":"0.5","id":257},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":258},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#3$1","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"嗯？是我听错了吧？","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":261},{"type":"charslot","id":262},{"type":"playsound","key":"$blooddrop","id":263},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":264},{"type":"text","text":"清晰的水滴声回荡在空寂的摄影棚里，像在回应霍汀的疑问，但如此善解人意的“举动”却给她带来更大的困惑和恐慌。","id":265},{"type":"text","text":"霍汀清楚地知道，自己所在的区域上方没有水管排布，可她听到的声音却是从极近的地方传来的。","id":266},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#5$1","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"谁！到底是谁在那里！","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"你们又想拿我找乐子，在收工之后把这个笑话当作下酒菜吗？","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"只、只要你们现在出来，我绝对不会怪你们！连小莫伊拉都参与了这个恶作剧？你们怎么能这样教小孩子——","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_1846_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":272},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1846_1#6$1","id":273},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,-80","duration":"0.6","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":274},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","id":275},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"15","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"唉哟——","id":277},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":278},{"type":"dialog","id":279},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":280},{"type":"charslot","id":281},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":282},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_62_i03.png","screenadapt":"coverall","y":"-180","id":283},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.5","yScaleFrom":"1.5","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"60","yTo":"0","id":284},{"type":"playsound","key":"$blooddrop","id":285},{"type":"text","text":"霍汀跌坐在地上，腰后传来的异物感让她意识到原来自己带着手电。还没等她自嘲，一股刺鼻的甜腥味撞进了她的鼻腔。","id":286},{"type":"text","text":"她在惊恐中站起身，打开了手电——","id":287},{"type":"dialog","id":288},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_doorknob","id":289},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":290},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_creepy_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":291,"musicid":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":292},{"type":"cgitem","image":"cgitem_62_i03","style":"cg","pfrom":"0,-30","pto":"0,0","pduration":"10","layer":"1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","aduration":"3","sfrom":"1.5","sto":"1","sduration":"60","id":293},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":294},{"type":"text","text":"一阵风，悬吊在高处的绳索被吹动，那两个霍汀再熟悉不过的人轻轻地晃动着，不争不吵。","id":295},{"type":"text","text":"迈克尔与玛丽昂，这对一直以来引发着全剧组热议的“恋人”，背对着迎接了死亡。","id":296},{"type":"text","text":"借着微弱的光源，霍汀看清了他们的脸，他们的表情，他们身体摆动的幅度，以及曼妙起舞的灰尘......","id":297},{"type":"text","text":"她感受到了一种，难以言喻的诡异和......神圣。","id":298},{"type":"text","text":"她突然想起，蒂比之前拉着自己看恐怖片的时候说过......","id":299},{"type":"text","text":"在哥伦比亚荒原上某些部落的仪式里，悬吊意味着对死者的审判，意味着对有罪生者的警示。","id":300},{"type":"text","text":"直到烈日的暴晒使得尸体开裂，直到所有人都认为他们罪有应得，直到绳子再也承受不住罪恶的重量——","id":301},{"type":"dialog","id":302},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":303},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown3","id":304},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown2","channel":"a","delay":"0.1","id":305},{"type":"text","text":"砰！","id":306},{"type":"dialog","id":307},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"倒霉的场工","text":"快、快来人啊——！","id":309},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":310},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2.5","id":311},{"type":"text","text":"倒霉的场工踉跄着向外面跑去，她想——","id":312},{"type":"text","text":"这是一个多么荒唐的早晨。","id":313},{"type":"dialog","id":314},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":315},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":316},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":317},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":318},{"type":"image","id":319},{"type":"charslot","id":320}],"characters":["蒂比","莫伊拉","玛丽昂","迈克尔","蒂比&莫伊拉","倒霉的场工"]}